    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't think i can let go of the weight without leaving. like, if i stay, i'm just constantly adding more to their plate. they're already so stressed. wouldn't it be more selfless to just... stop being the problem? to just give them the space to actually succeed without me always being the thing that holds them back?",
